Package: omniAPIr
Type: Package
Title: Unified Interface to Multiple International Data APIs
Version: 0.4.8
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Riccardo", "Soldan",
      email = "riccardosoldan@hotmail.it",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Author: Riccardo Soldan [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Riccardo Soldan <riccardosoldan@hotmail.it>
Description: Provides a unified interface to retrieve data from multiple international
    APIs including ACLED (conflict data), ILO (labor statistics), WHO (health indicators),
    FAOSTAT (agriculture data), World Bank, UN SDG, UNDP HDR, FAO EMPRES-i (animal diseases),
    IBAT (biodiversity), Giga (school connectivity), Climate Watch (NDC data), HDX HAPI
    (humanitarian data), GBIF/GRIIS (invasive species), OpenStreetMap, FAO Fishstat,
    and Copernicus Marine. All functions feature consistent
    parameter naming, automatic pagination, smart year discovery, and comprehensive error handling.
